#: scenario3:scenario3_F74B4BC4_D8C5_4733_9ABF_35269E2F4E1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 582cf5d7d3f374dac503d7c671ecd6037d3ebc15c444492172a1473b7646fa5b
#. default-sha256: 853b7ac6e42aa4ef888d1e0a61c39019c4f92959ca4dfae8142d7a9f6e193620
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F74B4BC4_D8C5_4733_9ABF_35269E2F4E1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫As I am sure "
"you’re aware,⟪k:15⟫our parents arranged our marriage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫あなたも知っている"
"と思うけど、⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫私たちが結婚したのは両親が定めたこと。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E3921769_2D38_4C09_BE2B_C3FAB8954F5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 666a3b30f73b4a4bf8c295a9811c94faa7a7818656356d81c0ba55a5b2ff713f
#. default-sha256: d2a117393c9d70fdbeeebdb2a8bbffb1216aeea788b9ed0b5c199f19d47c9037
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E3921769_2D38_4C09_BE2B_C3FAB8954F5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Before I emigrated to this country to be married,⟪k:1⟫I lived in a misty island nation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫結婚して、⟪k:1⟫移民としてこの国の人間になる前は、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫霧の多い島国に居ました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAC7B3C0_732D_409E_89FB_BA5DA7F7AA85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 737d1f18b19b6c6a18b0be0650231a978cda685c2b72704aa4ff2763d5494ebd
#. default-sha256: 82ba5965d271463f5ff9f675c8ac36007165a5f97cfc25e1ae78fb987d1e1339
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAC7B3C0_732D_409E_89FB_BA5DA7F7AA85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Portraits of my ancestors hung in the house where I lived; ⟪k:1⟫I remember as a child "
"wincing in fear at the sight of them staring down at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫家には先祖の肖像画が飾られていたりして、⟪k:1⟫幼いころ、⟪k:2⟫あの瞳に睨まれると身がすくむ思い"
"がしたのを覚えています。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DBE1D544_437A_4EA1_A4AE_72415CC8A542
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96942d252014088fc4409c9b8757e065e067cb7015a6e35d743da0199ae29594
#. default-sha256: 2be2974b4b14533e2d0a0c4862c1af7b5e4baf84587bacc5dd210e7d65d8b51e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DBE1D544_437A_4EA1_A4AE_72415CC8A542"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My mother and father were constantly telling me to show them respect, as it was their hard "
"work that kept our bloodline alive and well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫お父様やお母様は、⟪k:1⟫あの方々が私たちの血筋を守ったのだから、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫礼儀を怠らないように"
"と口を酸っぱくして言っていたけれど……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9DD4ED73_16F9_4FFC_9EFC_98614F6F2EE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b928c7e94241776b087cc6bb0a0af73e5b848a8cb846c3c3562f023e7b17c685
#. default-sha256: 5217ac66a6cbc13a650279a879107ed35507d1a07295082997eb9c7eb00a836a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9DD4ED73_16F9_4FFC_9EFC_98614F6F2EE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, they were fighting an uphill battle to do the same."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お父様もお母様も、⟪k:1⟫きっと、⟪k:2⟫必死だったんですね……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫あの家を守るために。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_072A1B06_90A2_4577_BCBE_5C088CD6E1A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e51e44b1e9cd087ef7a1227b0e6133c97987bb60f812c613f47b8926e292977
#. default-sha256: da6f7764bc2631472a43a09bf685f6ba94d061be7251751fb7c1bed2dbcb3fbf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_072A1B06_90A2_4577_BCBE_5C088CD6E1A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would have been clear to anyone reasonably perceptive that our house was coming tumbling "
"down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫勘の鋭い人は、⟪k:2⟫私たちの一家が転がり落ちていることに、⟪k:3⟫気がつかないはずもな"
"い。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_933D312C_E93D_4CEC_AA55_C9D4130C9584
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ec65acf607d771a8d0c35d24aa0f53d57123bf75c2e55342634ddb7b88f2f95
#. default-sha256: b9f4c02ee1aed39f6205e110eceb1d3ae593430e11ee3e03cf149dea006fa1d1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_933D312C_E93D_4CEC_AA55_C9D4130C9584"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Valuable furniture and paintings slowly disappeared, and eventually, the portraits were gone "
"too."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫大事な調度品や絵画はどんどんなくなり、⟪k:1⟫遂に先祖の絵も消えてしまいました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_276FA1EE_7BE7_42FE_B7B8_38F135004E9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c56cf0457862ca823509a7ad53e2a4d1b1ea064ce884150cb4a773e2b1d23929
#. default-sha256: b77e7aa6efde5c72c3a92072562a8a1f6cc89c3f9a9650171f64709b5685ee54
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_276FA1EE_7BE7_42FE_B7B8_38F135004E9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As our house collapsed, so too did my parents’ health deteriorate, robbing us of any source "
"of income."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫家が没落していくと共に、⟪k:1⟫父も母も体調を崩しがちになって、⟪k:2⟫お金を稼ぐ宛てもなく……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_370DA7F7_699A_42D9_A365_056EF3436F72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 207237212172db09ece4811cc39a6680278cf741c03ef3c3b379e58f857058bd
#. default-sha256: 3a3fe8712c61932a1e2962dbdf9dd4820997e54e8692696d7fcc931b635d3811
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_370DA7F7_699A_42D9_A365_056EF3436F72"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And though I was educated, I lacked the skills necessary to obtain work."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私には教養はありましたけれど、⟪k:1⟫それは仕事に繋がりません。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D3D7A52A_B8DB_4C19_BA09_60E282AE0634
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 491981e79ed953171e2dd34dd236eb86c5f4f5f25b9f0162c3d41fa801ad5c96
#. default-sha256: 3ff00cb61b2c3c3f84595dcd67c463632c576d023cc4e7ba238b1ddca3d6ceb9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D3D7A52A_B8DB_4C19_BA09_60E282AE0634"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just as we were about to run out of money and options, my parents received Jacopo’s parents’ "
"marriage proposition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私たちは路頭に迷う寸前でした。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……結婚話が舞い込んできたのは、⟪k:3⟫ちょうどそのころで"
"した。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D3F0987D_A17D_4E12_8D2D_F1D04AA0CB79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07f0b308824921c7497b11a188201c10895ced4d04067c2c4d78fa99abaa0d7f
#. default-sha256: c0abb89f8a1b798d79138de2decc71fd062f27dc6bdab0280d633582af88c577
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D3F0987D_A17D_4E12_8D2D_F1D04AA0CB79"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Both of our families stood to benefit from the arrangement.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had social status, "
"and he had wealth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫お互いの利害が一致したのでしょう。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫私には名家という社会的立場があり、⟪k:3⟫あの人には"
"資産があった。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_101759FA_890B_4EFB_81BB_B46CB0E7B3E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 817bfd5ec1704b156a61fbef681c4616c4e95758b151850b4142d5f87f1282ca
#. default-sha256: f79bb70c391a956f80f6ffdb0e49dfc0656e144d4aef433102d0453577d13754
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_101759FA_890B_4EFB_81BB_B46CB0E7B3E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We each had what the other lacked."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫逆に言えば、⟪k:1⟫お互いに足りなかったのもそこでした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FDFCE645_52E3_4461_A4EA_211D5297E6B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c56f7ecaf94c534111f0c817b5a66baea317eb944698826c417ff27388520ca8
#. default-sha256: 4f3f1b355ffd5e667a90660c436625e9e227c5277a1f8711e68af979afe4fde0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FDFCE645_52E3_4461_A4EA_211D5297E6B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One needs more than money to make it in the world.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Without at least a semi-"
"reputable name attached to you,⟪k:3⟫you’re liable to get laughed out of most social gatherings."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫世の中を渡り歩くには、⟪k:1⟫お金だけでは駄目だったのです。⟪k:2⟫社交界に出ても蔑まれない程度"
"に、⟪k:3⟫家系にも価値がないとならないのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3F9E8416_8158_49CE_B53C_3ABD9A69FB6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e8c081e1222e87d81e5d6d76af47abb3334d0e6599c8b12468ce0508c91d5e4
#. default-sha256: 173989b175e1f667f085c1d7a64d4f1be6d487d63da0342e3f3fd3eddf99bec4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3F9E8416_8158_49CE_B53C_3ABD9A69FB6A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I first met Jacopo here, in this country.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We didn’t even know what the other looked "
"like until our wedding day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ですから……、⟪k:1⟫私とあの人が初めて顔を会わせたのも、⟪k:2⟫この国です。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫結婚するま"
"で、⟪k:5⟫お互いの顔すら知らなかったのですから。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EC6CE469_9E0E_4596_B092_7CE515148639
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69f9156ddc19f24cbfa0f3d05f17df15a23c6cb432480b143389403ea15cb3d9
#. default-sha256: 711371f06056a18d0fbe77864d740482f6822eacc3098769fe3b11d358c5cd5f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EC6CE469_9E0E_4596_B092_7CE515148639"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To be quite honest, I was scared to death at first.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was so nervous. What kind of "
"man would he be?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Was I to be wed to some middle-aged stranger?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫正直言うと……当時は恐ろしくてなりませんでした。⟪k:1⟫緊張しました。⟪k:2⟫どんな人なのかしら、"
"⟪k:3⟫もう四十や五十のおじさんなのではないかしら……と。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_57B4CD43_0996_4BFA_93C0_65EA9CA4E18A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 008a17bf48797a746212695b57bd3ccd31020cd47ac7faba87cca2c95b3e9ac0
#. default-sha256: acd0d566de2b90c0b6d62486bcc3784815171dbefd16e64f75c31c510dd2c3ab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_57B4CD43_0996_4BFA_93C0_65EA9CA4E18A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We were not marrying because we had fallen in love like a normal couple."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私とあの人は、⟪k:1⟫普通の男女のように恋愛をしてこうなったのではありませんでした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_736DA51F_F6C1_4E3A_A414_D9879E31B034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7ed5236c87384ffd70c7e286f41b02636553abf102bfe375f01b149891ed9d4
#. default-sha256: f335e2ab1cb31697726de84657bbc043adb19d4740e4a96b65b59a205e796d99
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_736DA51F_F6C1_4E3A_A414_D9879E31B034"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew I was in no position to be concerned with such things,⟪k:1⟫but when I thought about "
"our future, I shook with fear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫自分のことを憂える立場でも状況でもないのに、⟪k:1⟫先のことを考えると、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫震えてしまった"
"のです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DA9DA23A_2141_4983_AE01_EE5D3C61858A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe20443cb7108ddc24fd8afe764be27c11cab224071efb9f2f5b5a7590722713
#. default-sha256: 832b126208618a5841add813c82bb46051c1db2172f5d5cab44c9fae4e71e6f7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DA9DA23A_2141_4983_AE01_EE5D3C61858A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the man I saw through my veil at the wedding was remarkable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫式で、⟪k:2⟫ヴェール越しに見たあの人は、⟪k:3⟫とても素敵でした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_41F047EC_6FF2_4718_A8B2_2212EB7E4302
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc05edc0864bb7424c34454086c12c337bae2c570f0443756e130a28b344fd33
#. default-sha256: 8169831424fe869e37cbb1f12a34f4e132e91d860002235f14d798f3b35d3e43
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_41F047EC_6FF2_4718_A8B2_2212EB7E4302"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was young, had strong, masculine eyes,⟪k:1⟫and at the same time, he too appeared nervous."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫若くて、⟪k:1⟫男らしい瞳をしていて、⟪k:2⟫それでちょっと緊張していたように思えます。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_15C24639_C5DE_457E_A063_7A017E7B0AB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b6b9c33616e09dbc8e7ec479ca90cca72e203037f798bb1c3327cead6a1df3f
#. default-sha256: 3104e1cc0894ba14e591dd1692bfd61d068903804aecabade5629fab89306885
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15C24639_C5DE_457E_A063_7A017E7B0AB7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫He was shaking as much—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫no, even more than me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ふふ……、⟪k:1⟫私も同じように、⟪k:2⟫いいえ、⟪k:3⟫それ以上にがちがちでした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_84835AAC_2787_4917_BED2_E2CF58959E44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80ec76a54163304f67df57e1cb92666e870276e17e8090ba2178f7fde8ddf08a
#. default-sha256: c30bcbb5ef07f69fd4aa2035afab10d0b66cf0786a35e17f6f018df8344a1237
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_84835AAC_2787_4917_BED2_E2CF58959E44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seeing that, the priest gave an impish little smirk when he asked Jacopo if he vowed his "
"eternal love to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それを見たのでしょうか、⟪k:1⟫神父様が永遠の愛を聞いた時、⟪k:2⟫彼はちょっと悪戯っぽく笑ってく"
"れました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74AF65CC_87AB_4374_9A1B_21EAA1FFC794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1aaab29d9c537173f35eca16b216dbbcf9447fd464b9376f765a6b0be819636b
#. default-sha256: 3d61b9ca4e2ded4f8bffba75c27f02072c642c59e74dbe766a06dc92859c1322
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74AF65CC_87AB_4374_9A1B_21EAA1FFC794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I... ⟪k:1⟫counted myself among the happy. ⟪k:2⟫And I still do.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫For in that moment, "
"I experienced true love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私……、⟪k:1⟫幸せな部類だと思います。⟪k:2⟫今でもそう思っているんです。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫だってその時、"
"⟪k:5⟫私はちゃんと、⟪k:6⟫恋をしたのだもの。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_23632B1E_62F8_4ED5_B3D8_9FC3A4A6F783
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc3429171e0d944e260809983b014735d31837863673d13990d2d7ed37872f1a
#. default-sha256: 9c2c5f025e2f4882df33a60d4b67cc61aa781523addd04fdb25796cef3f7c3b3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_23632B1E_62F8_4ED5_B3D8_9FC3A4A6F783"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...You wanted to hear about when he was kind to me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well, after the wedding, we "
"were given a week to ourselves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……彼が、⟪k:1⟫優しかった時の話でしたね。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫そう、⟪k:4⟫その後、⟪k:5⟫私たちには一週間が与"
"えられました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FD31C664_E284_4A4B_82AA_884CB3236C8A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13163718873211d4fa9d0e6a8f154a7a82323f0ec73e669c8ff0d8951201bb8b
#. default-sha256: ea32d5a25e51fc36f210436203897f9835f717e609fc95344e167f4198614b12
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD31C664_E284_4A4B_82AA_884CB3236C8A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suppose you could call it a honeymoon, though we didn’t take a trip overseas—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or "
"even go very far at all."
msgstr ""
