#: scenario3:scenario3_09F1954E_E863_48A3_AB29_810051BD9AC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a0f613ffe529042118af1986521e26c8cd7e7da4468b4368d163fe244df1542
#. default-sha256: 1e0329516649484dbc13bf129ea32cc1e8ce1f9d1e7f11bc677cdab29c1de006
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_09F1954E_E863_48A3_AB29_810051BD9AC9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But every festival has its underside.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I also saw overworked men, looking like they "
"were on the verge of collapse, drinking water from a spigot on the side of the road."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……でも、⟪k:1⟫お祭りには影もあるのですね。⟪k:2⟫道端の蛇口から水を飲む労働者の顔は、⟪k:3⟫疲労一"
"色で、⟪k:4⟫今にも倒れ込みそうでした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_81720A2E_E9C4_42AD_8CE4_1F595F4C433A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 583568a75300ae7b31fb119e60248926b936573b0f2ae38c73a4e57a5926077b
#. default-sha256: da59944c1c8cb6a96db421d86be2807cfdb42218a1401f0e0b632e3a53457114
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81720A2E_E9C4_42AD_8CE4_1F595F4C433A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫By way of contrast, I wore fine clothing and had a carriage at my disposal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それに比べて、⟪k:1⟫私はこんなにも良い服を着て、⟪k:2⟫外に出るのだって馬車を使って……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_26A919A1_89F1_4143_8922_218DC4FC45E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f544249a393700922c748fc1e424e274743a09d133483a9414aaba293926ef5a
#. default-sha256: 277b447b30b0892d64180a4f8179951302d1bc6397989e63bb5afe4dedabcfe5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_26A919A1_89F1_4143_8922_218DC4FC45E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I imagine every day was a struggle for them just to remain afloat."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼らはきっと、⟪k:1⟫毎日生きるのが精いっぱいなくらいに、⟪k:2⟫辛い生活を送っているのでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC0B0531_15BA_4CEB_862A_21A6FAF15CBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa545be7e7f25bf724b50065bd3b39a220bd9ebdac553a97a56c0bfe6d2b74b5
#. default-sha256: 87bdad1d46344426cbb57609c513a862c55ba4df417e38d039594d48f8fda819
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC0B0531_15BA_4CEB_862A_21A6FAF15CBC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had I not married the man I had, I too might have found myself on the streets in a similar "
"situation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫もし私が、⟪k:1⟫彼と結婚していなければ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私も、⟪k:4⟫同じような境遇となったのかもしれ"
"ません。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F4922A8A_F0C8_45C0_8543_304E7803862E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce6c21851f363f3510c2e7d3fd52f9e486b64a0a9952f8d4321105fdac50a50e
#. default-sha256: 57237da63b7e97552aecc696f7fea74ef21f0fba887fba19a2b1db2a64a1e262
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F4922A8A_F0C8_45C0_8543_304E7803862E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not relief that spread through my breast at the sight of them—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was "
"pangs of guilt."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私の胸をじわりと滲ませたのは、⟪k:1⟫安堵ではなく、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫罪悪感に近いものでした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4da9b8f460524aa09911101151d26dab8eb58101a8d69249a1b0efa8d77317dd
#. default-sha256: 2601b16c5e9f6c6f11027135c1736c608d60564726066de707cc025649e2fc84
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It felt to me like a life of opulence was wrong—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫sinful."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お金のある、⟪k:1⟫質の高い生活を保つということが……罪深く思えました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12eb672c9185f23c578099d6ac7c90f38e80cbd322ff05f4313a685f2c6ffd34
#. default-sha256: 0306e31772a452169b9c6e0b7f87179ce981133cd7013eb2d3f690f9c4dd2188
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It broke my heart to know that I was living so much better than them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私ばかり良い生活をしている。⟪k:1⟫そのことが、⟪k:2⟫心苦しかったのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 601e84f7393ce1fc18f358ca152d083ffbe6c77765089d2495e8ee9ab20e1144
#. default-sha256: 8d5370bf3791fa0399b5152c0cae2071ff045d41526d64e3267e1b2e227d85a4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Jacopo snorted disapprovingly at me,⟪k:1⟫seemingly reading my mind, and then said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そんな私の様子を、⟪k:1⟫彼は察したのでしょうか。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫不機嫌そうに鼻を鳴らして、⟪k:4⟫こう"
"言いました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6a5740ee1a02980db420768485d4de18ce1b00e8182f3a46aeebc3e3bf5e04d
#. default-sha256: 6acbdfcaf5d1ec514bf92eb07f54a0e8ad2ac51f7495d99fca4e3da628764fa0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The poor man who envies the rich, covets his wealth, and finds the ambition to make the same "
"for himself; and the rich man who pities the poor, thinking it his duty to give them offerings of "
"philanthropy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫裕福な者を妬み羨み、⟪k:1⟫そこに辿り着いてやるという野心。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫貧乏な者を嘆き憐み、⟪k:4⟫"
"施しを与えてやらねばという同情。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2486e18cd8c5b41378f875b33470e0b9f3671f325d51021e37579c929889d2c4
#. default-sha256: 26a9172999945e4a9fe29f3fd530de45b88691f378ad71fa73fb6b637b24c85c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To me, the latter is the far more nefarious.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Excessive charity will ruin a man—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫make him come to ⟪k:5⟫expect⟪k:6⟫ handouts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私にとっては、⟪k:1⟫後者の方が罪深いがな。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫過剰な施しは人間を堕落させる。⟪k:4⟫貰うこ"
"とが当然になってしまうのだよ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45349f94dca68519e4b6d444903c0f6fec8f7d009712087347d4f44ab2ad5b46
#. default-sha256: 363ab0ee8261e749a08b5ff90a3b15a454d40c020af9f988fb49a04782bf48f2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then there are those with the wrong idea of pity,⟪k:1⟫who let themselves fall down to "
"the same place,⟪k:2⟫mistakenly believing it will somehow make the poor feel better."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それに――憐れみ方を間違える奴は、⟪k:1⟫同じ場所まで転落する。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫同じ立場に立つことが、"
"⟪k:4⟫奴らに対する救いだと勘違いするのだ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80e4436516ad39405895d426bfe27c74a66ecf80aedd823affa210032301a794
#. default-sha256: 7d5c106712a13acbc6e5246acd766251e72e5c5a383092ad10efe251654f08f2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What a joke.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you’re going to do anything for them,⟪k:3⟫you might as well "
"encourage them to climb upward.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Spur on economic growth and the flow of capital."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫笑い話だ。⟪k:1⟫それくらいなら、⟪k:2⟫誰もが上を目指した方が良い。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫金も巡るし、⟪k:5⟫経"
"済も発展する。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d34fd1c9ae50a6bc27922f0266feadd02ae5fbf9e18bdc6c9824f4cd454f68ea
#. default-sha256: 039d699df4f1ff9754ee1cc343411b0e87116d595a01aed4ec7e4540124b03e0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Doesn’t that sound like the better option?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その方が良いだろう？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2d60e1e993f821e346c146f3e6c97873a6a1521478ad108c0a99825c6483238
#. default-sha256: 686061325bcf3ef517d4cd68ccb33e8e2bdbcbffe00a27498894fc820910aa42
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I say nothing, simply smiling and giving an ambiguous nod."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私は何も言えず、⟪k:1⟫あいまいに微笑んで頷いてしまいました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb9bd99d999a6b3bef15d1202a022e1c2ce64b38893fb2e1f28c887c9b0e59e0
#. default-sha256: 9442d7d2275ba325303cf245330e932bbcd2f2315c8b31a6c61e02163ca2f064
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had a point—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫my sympathy and guilt meant nothing to people actually experiencing "
"hardship."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫確かに、⟪k:1⟫私の抱える罪悪感や、⟪k:2⟫同情といったものは……不遇の境遇である方々にとって、⟪k:3⟫"
"何の意味もないのでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80ead359382e970c3c4fde3b31d886f2f360816bad7aeb8d596aff489fefef80
#. default-sha256: f7c43a4d1330c2f6aabc7aabfd3b4abae8d3ba644c9f7db6aad9a515893ba0e4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If, feeling guilty of my own fortune, I acted upon that pity in the way he had described, it "
"would accomplish little more than self-satisfaction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫自分の立場を申し訳なく思い、⟪k:1⟫例え同じことをしたとしても、⟪k:2⟫それは自己満足に過ぎないん"
"です。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aafaa751cd4dc203586b6fb419c1f6a1198ae0c09fa2ae3e42a997ed1852195f
#. default-sha256: 29cfac7bbaef42acdf9c08e6a3240db35e96775ad23a2999d991b485d5bf184c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He seemed to have seen straight through to my very core."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私という人間を、⟪k:1⟫彼は見抜いていたのかもしれませんね。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫元から、⟪k:4⟫資産運用でお"
"金を増やしてきた人です。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3fe4dc43fea80cb64364b373b6fe1e8042520cb55eb31f27dc29ff62be2363a
#. default-sha256: d4858ed12d4aa11cb03997dac38011a5f4059d872ca787b0497b30fd37f4932d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This was a man who had built his own fortune through investment, which I imagine required "
"him to be rather astute."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫きっと、⟪k:1⟫観察眼があるのでしょう……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0604d321e68bad21aa27e9a632f020348055e5e9964311b0e669b5c84c5811c
#. default-sha256: ecacf112669e36cd954bcdc57dfda64af33cf380155cc4395fa2395b1ccc454e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But doesn’t a world where everyone is constantly trying to climb higher and higher sound "
"rather... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫exhausting?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫でも……。⟪k:1⟫誰もが上を目指して走り続ける世界というのは、⟪k:2⟫少し、⟪k:3⟫疲れそうじゃありませ"
"んか？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8662226d9a26f14964faada038188011b9a92fef6e703518342f9443ec10475
#. default-sha256: b574860a8a26b00db8c25175421a4ee2c8c4d2f6b0c2e3d3fb4ae370da3d7450
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, personally, would prefer to be in a position where I could watch—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫if only from a "
"distance—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫as others climbed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私は、⟪k:1⟫例え遠くからでも、⟪k:2⟫走り続ける人を見守るような……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫そんな立場でありた"
"いと、⟪k:5⟫思いました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DFC0CC61_2D5D_40C2_A766_B58A603DD386
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: defed8116131baa4e52eab55f9e5496efcad462cc09397e9cc8a63ffa83e7c8f
#. default-sha256: 74bc65287dbf1718c494cfb603dac1d135f5c84c177446481b37de38989e5ea1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DFC0CC61_2D5D_40C2_A766_B58A603DD386"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But obviously, I could not say as much to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もちろん、⟪k:1⟫そんなことは口に出来ませんでしたけど……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB5E04E7_26DF_4498_AA3D_BF948827CA0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a46af9a526032f167e8a034eeb5f67366f81858ec6ab35e8aa72fecffee01b65
#. default-sha256: 9a924555cf62fac62d8132226b09d8d074ee871a0a9b93683edd96ac3a5b5dd8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EB5E04E7_26DF_4498_AA3D_BF948827CA0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Some time later, the carriage came to a stop in front of a shop."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……やがて馬車は、⟪k:4⟫あるお店の前で止まりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BBEABC7_9248_4DD0_B475_4022BDF38225
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c7607edcd730429c7b5abb1536115a3f3e6358bf901b12f9a4a59df5ef3f8d8
#. default-sha256: 8769f59ed098f11d3044bbfeee4e1256763f9742e636881f9208daa50d0a256b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BBEABC7_9248_4DD0_B475_4022BDF38225"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As I looked at the building perplexedly, he gestured to the door with his chin, signaling "
"for me to get out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不思議そうにする私に対し、⟪k:1⟫彼は顎で「出ろ」と示します。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5F2E2CD1_5675_47B5_88A9_30D721AC5D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b84086134eb56e0b4ea3cf3502b8120e29dde7ae298c2fdb5bd096db9310858d
#. default-sha256: 89af853ef8369eb7bba1d819de9e228faf43796fc5d1c68f0c97b01d6664796f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5F2E2CD1_5675_47B5_88A9_30D721AC5D8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lost and confused, I stepped down from the carriage,⟪k:1⟫and before me spread a showcase "
"behind a large glass window."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫訳も分からないまま降り立つと、⟪k:1⟫目の前にはガラス張りのショーケースがありました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8FA62325_56EE_4756_B4ED_B3B1168F68DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d444da45caa3454fac538da709c5631c912b30716d556ec148e62d0f50ddfbd
#. default-sha256: 3a2211466ab5beca4f7ef9ba7664ee28dc63c96e23fa2959b9ba374bd6f73c41
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8FA62325_56EE_4756_B4ED_B3B1168F68DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, lined up in the case were not precious metals or expensive clothing, ⟪k:1⟫but "
"machines."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫貴金属やお洋服などはありません。⟪k:2⟫そこにあったのは――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C0B8281B_8022_40D2_9847_71A7F98CAB60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d7e2816e83c2f2159b342ddadccbb721b55e4c52071a8560356876ef75e2600
