"⟪k:0⟫「なんだこのピッツァは！　⟪k:1⟫生地がまるでなっちゃおらん、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ゴムみたいなパンを食って"
"いるみたいだぞ！」とか――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0B1A017E_BF75_47D5_9F39_564F09E39F3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19eaceabd83f543f0f6a6f0479037e893d02bdd6691f38bd12be366334c2da73
#. default-sha256: 68cc09ee0e9e91c1684e42828175219e32331af9538b45ff887ce674aae96c8e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0B1A017E_BF75_47D5_9F39_564F09E39F3A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“How can you wave my country’s flag and not serve spaghetti?!⟪k:1⟫Do you have any shame at "
"all?!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「スパゲッティがないとはどういうことだ！　⟪k:1⟫これで我が国の国旗を掲げるとは、⟪k:2⟫面の皮が"
"分厚いにもほどがある」とか――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8F1C7A66_6E7B_4A53_A69B_27AE66AFAE91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a55a1b0b8a078c44f3ef562163e126a1186483e04eeea442074a504126beaf26
#. default-sha256: 851aa36f055afd67827a7e2aeb9fb4b535197fd8c47bd218161e5d0df36787c8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8F1C7A66_6E7B_4A53_A69B_27AE66AFAE91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“This wine is pitifully unbalanced! Far too high levels of acidity.⟪k:1⟫Listen to me "
"carefully—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the house wine is the face of a restaurant.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「なんだこのワインは！　⟪k:1⟫酸味のバランスがまるでなっちゃおらん。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　いいか、⟪k:4⟫"
"ハウスワインというのはその店の顔なのだぞ」とか。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E545B29B_B96E_4188_A1EE_6F72C0084E70
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15c80092715579e3a40f083345161cc504c60d2eb2bd24014899dee43982a54f
#. default-sha256: a525d93382e6e0531a7ce0b35b284807832009d0f95d1ae849c98359f9d78259
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E545B29B_B96E_4188_A1EE_6F72C0084E70"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He complained about every little thing.⟪k:1⟫It was a complete disaster."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ことあるごとに彼は文句を言って、⟪k:1⟫なんだかもう、⟪k:2⟫めちゃくちゃでした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A254ECAD_7658_450A_92BC_2199D6436909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3673148c8adffe7973aa502a7c2453c6cd105233d38132d4c3d70432d3de8ef9
#. default-sha256: 4b6f9d373bb733f65cb3a7977dff9c743fbb746dee3ce905ab7bab2880e7c410
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A254ECAD_7658_450A_92BC_2199D6436909"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But curiously enough, I was not at all put off by his behavior."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫不思議ですね。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私、⟪k:4⟫そういう彼の態度が、⟪k:5⟫ちっとも嫌にならなかった"
"んです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_37341C46_68D0_414F_BD92_A328C2B42AEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccd3fbf780203ba8a746a56fffa38cd31e301cc61057420a6591fb8691f9f776
#. default-sha256: 180ea34abff8775c1fbedb2a259cc43123121cce2e5cf7e8945602f709223c77
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37341C46_68D0_414F_BD92_A328C2B42AEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When the sun set, the carriage made its way to a nearby hill."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫陽が落ちきると、⟪k:1⟫馬車は丘の方へ向かいました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea5bae4978a1752d0eb1940283baad9891c9d6944f7f43c6c9be29092ae13f6d
#. default-sha256: 171bb0d2adc18500c05814ed1203417790d55fd78f27aac312d02da903611ae1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cool nighttime breeze felt wonderful on my skin, flushed from the alcohol, and the light "
"from the gas lamps had a comforting warmth to it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ほろ酔いの火照った肌に、⟪k:1⟫夜風はとても心地よく感じられて、⟪k:2⟫ガス灯の灯りも暖かみがあり"
"ました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e640e264b4f8fd2f0be2cb0077a9acb5a59d50be7005a3b335591afc1cce05ac
#. default-sha256: f3aa9f1effea946bc9dc9cb1000296d76063be214c2fd79f8deb0f3851b90bd3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though Jacopo had complained about the quality of the wine, once he had intoxicated himself, "
"his mood improved visibly. ⟪k:1⟫It made him unexpectedly talkative."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼も、⟪k:1⟫ワインの質に文句をつけていても、⟪k:2⟫酔ってしまえば機嫌は良くなるようでした。⟪k:3⟫"
"意外なほど饒舌に、⟪k:4⟫私に語ってくれるのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4BB2CF95_DFA5_4CAB_BBA6_69281459B5AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28fd79ab19d0bafa65b4518d58c895cb4c68a63673552bfbe05f7a17eff0e824
#. default-sha256: 7a047159096fab7e7733ce9f3edf3841779dc7f614b9f05dc133f1d1a57c7042
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4BB2CF95_DFA5_4CAB_BBA6_69281459B5AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Look out at the city.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫A gloomy town that shuts "
"down at night isn’t suited to expansion or growth. But this city isn’t like that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫見たまえ、⟪k:8⟫この街を。⟪k:9⟫夜になって静かになるような陰"
"気な街は、⟪k:10⟫発展に向いていない。⟪k:11⟫だが、⟪k:12⟫ここはそうではない。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_14472A94_21AB_417A_A65C_D703EBC95D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70b0cde2c8d4628189a8ad5f5b4eb46301c03f5ff9af1677dba4cf3cce733566
#. default-sha256: 06d5679b2eb9532a179fbc99e19104f624fd775da8aed4595aba8f81df32a484
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14472A94_21AB_417A_A65C_D703EBC95D8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You can see people walking beneath the lamps,⟪k:1⟫and you can hear the bustle of them "
"talking."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ガス灯の下には人影が見えるし、⟪k:1⟫賑やかな声も届いてくる……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_709A2976_748E_4697_B6D1_575115A0CB1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5aec9bee7f7873b8b10835986abd01d30694d51fe4563a692a2ff4daf1176ed0
#. default-sha256: 1554c902329c400a8d664c25c58e4cdb8a083cc3541c78229c35ec877b361a54
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_709A2976_748E_4697_B6D1_575115A0CB1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is a city that still has plenty of room to grow.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As they ride the rising wave "
"of the economy,⟪k:3⟫many, many more people will gather here."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫この街は、⟪k:1⟫まだまだ成長するぞ。⟪k:2⟫経済の波にのって、⟪k:3⟫もっともっと住民が増えるだろ"
"う。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_299E2B51_7F4E_4F47_8D97_6C4CCC79ACDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e69439c440e225297847c0f57c76fa85f801e3096ba6f3704eb67b918e48702
#. default-sha256: b8afcb0eb81d5af73b276988e50eaba49b6c6566511c555b55d84e7537d67d20
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_299E2B51_7F4E_4F47_8D97_6C4CCC79ACDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫More people means more money in circulation.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫More money in circulation means the "
"city grows,⟪k:3⟫companies are founded, and more goods are bought and sold."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫人が増えれば、⟪k:1⟫金の巡りが良くなる。⟪k:2⟫金の巡りが良くなれば、⟪k:3⟫街がでかくなる。⟪k:4⟫"
"会社が出来る。⟪k:5⟫物資が流通する。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_49676B00_307A_485B_A463_06A11753C9AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3aff9cc8e7b7eaa5a92efe187de831cae1beed519e421cae6de9b823c9df272
#. default-sha256: 066713504d69434f6c314b35997ad74d6380e0e3b8800390974a3ab42b8e31b9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_49676B00_307A_485B_A463_06A11753C9AE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Will it really change so drastically?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そんなに、⟪k:2⟫変わっていくものなんでしょうか……？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4136B471_10CD_4893_A969_986808AAED08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a46c1c09be6f1c438eb7cd2620a515103e5e60cf4449df6cd7fb0eee31eea531
#. default-sha256: 5aeb62890305f7e51cb23ac6416f285839532cbd48c499ca86f6a3940e0a1425
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4136B471_10CD_4893_A969_986808AAED08"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It can be difficult to see what’s happening from the inside.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The majority of "
"people just go about their daily lives,⟪k:4⟫and the next thing they know, things are different."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫変化の渦中というのは、⟪k:2⟫分かりにくいものなんだ。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫多くの人間がなあなあに生き"
"て、⟪k:5⟫その間に世界が変わっている。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_39734B13_3D4C_4B9B_A507_3A350D7C0483
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed98e5988c8894209d5ff435839d98a5e6535cc019637e00a3f8d8f465adec0f
#. default-sha256: cdda063608d80ce4f28dad5821e752e8a7545e0468e72e5b34b5343463497ca0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_39734B13_3D4C_4B9B_A507_3A350D7C0483"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’d wager most don’t notice the changes at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫いいや――世界が変わったことにすら、⟪k:2⟫気づかないのかもしれん。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C6C73090_D254_45AD_A1CB_9FE8662CAAFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11bd2ba819259407f0db30943be3815a9f2128ce45981a72da73a71d52ff58b3
#. default-sha256: 4fdd98ddc08c820c81a7e251807d285cc649a8c09c11289fdf5383cc49d66aac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C6C73090_D254_45AD_A1CB_9FE8662CAAFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Only those with eyes sharp enough to realize what’s happening can seize success. ⟪k:2⟫I "
"cannot afford to overlook even the most minute change."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫目ざとく気づいた者だけが、⟪k:2⟫成功を掴み取る。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……だからこそ、⟪k:5⟫見過ごすわけ"
"にはいかんのだ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C29F2513_568B_450D_B77C_A53EDD33F045
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f9e4d5f5ae40a83fdc29d45cba477094a58b0a079e686771dff2a9b5591c7f7
