msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A dream? I’m not sure if it’s easy enough to attain to call a dream. ⟪k:2⟫Others might "
"call it greed—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫or perhaps ambition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫夢……、⟪k:2⟫夢と言えるほど、⟪k:3⟫生易しいものかは分からんがな。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫他人は強欲と呼ぶ"
"かもしれんし、⟪k:6⟫野心と言うのかもしれん。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A6B61D0F_0F48_4645_A129_7AB9539C130F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30d5aaec0956c9e4251b2da6073a7b6d3efb09bf10968c15236953e742369f7e
