msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A6B61D0F_0F48_4645_A129_7AB9539C130F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t laugh, now.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My intention... ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is to make the world mine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫笑うなよ。⟪k:1⟫私はな――、⟪k:2⟫世界を取ってやるつもりでいるんだ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1F5A7FC2_1014_4BFD_BB44_B3C7137C281A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6288f8d075b165b2824c3afde91887ec1860fc4a570890e64f3afa21628007df
#. default-sha256: 5dee622d8fec3617ed4ff75c6dce81b1a5b6b4c5aeb59ba3e948d8fa1f12848f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1F5A7FC2_1014_4BFD_BB44_B3C7137C281A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The world..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫世界……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E76E4A67_8AF1_4E9E_B980_C8B65E3584E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23428ada358652252c8a4602f882f7cb733c8e1fde8106b0f516b66823473684
#. default-sha256: 770f94236ea50a303c5937fc26129c1000317770b1104a835e7547fa82de40b0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E76E4A67_8AF1_4E9E_B980_C8B65E3584E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yes, the world. ⟪k:2⟫And to do that, you need neither physical strength nor kindness—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but money and influence. ⟪k:5⟫People have no choice but to kneel before those forces."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ああ、⟪k:2⟫そうさ。⟪k:3⟫世界を取るために必要なのは、⟪k:4⟫腕力でも優しさでもない。⟪k:5⟫金"
"と権力だ。⟪k:6⟫人はそれらの前では、⟪k:7⟫屈服せざるを得ない。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AE0A56A8_93E1_4142_9227_BF1F768E2ECC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e56d65f8b8ff92fea4f10d642b78646038e23ceb4b6c2cdb2bb556760d4e4af
