msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Because... ⟪k:2⟫I want to change my country... ⟪k:3⟫I imagine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……国を……、⟪k:2⟫変えたいから、⟪k:3⟫かも……しれないな。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_007F1346_C85E_48E8_93A2_FDB14A468D04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4be38bcb0d5845d34d2489dc15e6cdf9e44d6a7c105ef1557133483e34738a9
